fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"frei0r/frei0r-filter-gate-weave.html#frei0r-filter-gate-weave:maximum-horizontal-movement","fragment":"\n\tmaximum-horizontal-movement\n\nThe maximum distance the picture could move left or right. The larger the number the more the picture moves and the less subtle the effect.\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\t0.2\n\n"});